20:["$","section","facts",{"id":"facts","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":["3. 返事を、成果物と照合する",["$","a",null,{"className":"heading-anchor","href":"#facts","aria-label":"この節へのリンク","children":"#"}]]}],[],false,[["$","div","0",{"children":[["$","div","0",{"dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<p>「保存しました」という返事を読んだあとも、ファイルと検証結果を確かめます。セーブポイントには、要約、引き継ぎ書、復元情報をまとめて残します。外部から届いた報告は、通知の「開く」から読み、元の成果物へ進めます。</p>\n<table class=\"two-column-table\">\n<thead>\n<tr><th>確かめるもの</th><th>分かること</th></tr></thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr><td data-label=\"確かめるもの\">ファイルと検査の出力</td><td data-label=\"分かること\">何ができ、どの検査を通ったか。</td></tr>\n<tr><td data-label=\"確かめるもの\">作業した相手の説明</td><td data-label=\"分かること\">何を発見し、なぜそう判断したか。</td></tr></tbody></table><p>受け取り箱と、対応が必要なタブを示す「気づき」列は別の機能です。<a href=\"/guide/agents#done\">完了の確かめ方</a>に、照合する項目をまとめています。</p>"}}]]}]]]}]
21:["$","section","keys",{"id":"keys","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":["4. 操作の相手を確かめる",["$","a",null,{"className":"heading-anchor","href":"#keys","aria-label":"この節へのリンク","children":"#"}]]}],[],false,[["$","div","0",{"children":[["$","div","0",{"dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<p>起動、送信、読取、終了の相手を、タブと実行の記録で確かめます。<strong>hook</strong> は、エージェントが終了や質問を知らせる仕組みです。知らせの権限は、相手のタブ、CLI の種類、起動回数、アプリの起動に結び付けます。</p>"}}]]}],["$","figure","1",{"className":"fig","data-fig":"F7","children":[["$","svg",null,{"className":"fig-wide","viewBox":"0 0 720 400","width":"100%","role":"img","aria-label":"ソケットのトークンと hook の capability という 2 つの鍵と、capability を束ねる 4 要素、守る範囲と守らない範囲","data-vw":720,"data-fs":15,"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","children":[["$","title",null,{"children":"ソケットのトークンと hook の capability という 2 つの鍵と、capability を束ねる 4 要素、守る範囲と守らない範囲"}],["$","defs",null,{"children":[["$","marker",null,{"id":"F7-wide-arrow","viewBox":"0 0 10 10","refX":"9","refY":"5","markerWidth":"8","markerHeight":"8","orient":"auto-start-reverse","children":["$","path",null,{"d":"M0 0L10 5L0 10z","className":"arrowhead"}]}],["$","marker",null,{"id":"F7-wide-arrow-accent","viewBox":"0 0 10 10","refX":"9","refY":"5","markerWidth":"8","markerHeight":"8","orient":"auto-start-reverse","children":["$","path",null,{"d":"M0 0L10 5L0 10z","className":"arrowhead accent"}]}]]}],[["$","g","0",{"children":[["$","path",null,{"d":"M550 136L550 172","className":"edge","markerEnd":"url(#F7-wide-arrow)","markerStart":"$undefined"}],["$","g",null,{"className":"edge-label-group","children":[["$","rect",null,{"x":490.3,"y":142.75,"width":119.4,"height":22.5,"rx":4,"className":"edge-label-bg"}],["$","text",null,{"x":550,"y":159.25,"textAnchor":"middle","fontSize":15,"className":"edge-label","children":"4 要素に束ねる"}]]}]]}]],[["$","g","k1",{"className":"node n-accent","data-w":340,"data-id":"k1","children":[["$","rect",null,{"x":0,"y":0,"width":340,"height":136,"rx":8}],["$","text",null,{"x":170,"textAnchor":"middle","fon